      "writtenOn": "2022-11-30T18:15:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I likely don\u0027t have the complete picture here (and my Vulkan knowledge is lacking) but could this generally address a mappable vertex buffer that\u0027s populated on the CPU, as well as an unmapped GPU-private buffer (as in `MTLResourceStorageModePrivate` in Metal) that, say, a compute shader would populate?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 49,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 50,
        "endChar": 100
      },
      "revId": "ab7ced2c9ca1193ae70186b6e1df9a34690208c3",
